	(text "K-10 DECIDED (fail-off): 4.7 k pull-down on the enable, main MCU drives it through 1 k, supervisor veto via one BSS138.\nOn Rev B the enable node is LM51551 UVLO/EN (FLY_EN). EN rising threshold 0.4-0.7 V, UVLO 1.425-1.575 V (SNVSB75E).\nMCU high: 3.3 V x 4.7/(4.7+1) = 2.72 V -> run.  Pull-down only: 0 V -> shutdown.  BSS138 on: ~0 V -> shutdown.\nUNRESOLVED (OPEN item 3 / CF-9): BSS138 gate default. R403 (pull-UP, veto on by default) and R404 (pull-DOWN,\nas wired on Rev A) are BOTH placed DNP. Owner decision required before build. With neither fitted the gate floats\nwhile the supervisor is in reset - this is NOT an acceptable build state. SG-03 must be run after the decision."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 20 0)
